  "body": "* Designed Elegance & Functional Layout\r\n* Versatile Multi-Level Living Zones\r\n* Exceptional Open-Plan Living\r\n* Low-Maintenance Executive Lifestyle\r\n* Prime Coastal Location\r\n\r\nExperience premium low-maintenance executive living in Orewa's coveted Ara Hills. Set on 453m² freehold land with a 251m² indoor floor area, this well-designed two-level luxury home offers generous space, modern styling and superb functionality for families, professionals and coastal lifestyle seekers.\r\n\r\nFeaturing sleek architectural lines and high-end finishes throughout, this practical dual-level layout balances modern aesthetics and daily functionality. Meticulously designed to suit family living, guest stays and casual entertaining effortlessly.\r\n\r\nDownstairs: Offers two spacious bedrooms, a private lounge perfect for extended family, teens or guests, a full bathroom, and a practical double internal-access garage with secure parking and ample storage.\r\nUpstairs: Includes three bright bedrooms with a luxurious private master suite. The property features 2.5 bathrooms in total, including a master ensuite and a powder room. The expansive light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area serves as a warm hub for family life and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe stylish designer kitchen anchors the upper living area, flowing smoothly into sunlit living and dining spaces. The flexible layout is ideal for quiet family downtime and casual social gatherings.\r\n\r\nSituated in exclusive Ara Hills, this premium home is minutes from beaches, walkways, cafés, schools and transport links. Combining coastal charm, modern comfort and great convenience, it delivers an exceptional premium coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nCall Team Vinson and Amy on 022 571 7074 today to arrange your private viewing.\r\nFor more information, please visit: vinsonamyandco.nz",
